                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does a marketplace app cost to build?</h3>
                                        <p>MVP: ₹40-80 lakh ($48K-96K). Full growth build: ₹1-2.2 Cr ($120K-265K). Enterprise multi-region: ₹2.5-6 Cr ($300K-720K).</p>
                                        <h3>Should I build my own payment escrow?</h3>
                                        <p>No. Use Razorpay Route (India), Stripe Connect (US/UK/UAE), or PayU Splits. Building custom payment infrastructure is expensive and creates unnecessary compliance burden.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest failure mode for marketplaces?</h3>
                                        <p>Weak vendor supply. Marketplaces are cold-start problems — solve the vendor side first (100+ quality vendors) before scaling buyer acquisition.</p>
                                        <h3>How long does marketplace development take?</h3>
                                        <p>MVP: 18-26 weeks. Growth build: 26-40 weeks. Enterprise: 40-60 weeks. Plan realistic timelines — marketplaces rushed to market fail more often than any other app category.</p>
